{"model":"nomic-embed-text:latest","input":["search_document: Field station generator FS-18 has serial number GEN-8831.","search_document: Generator FS-18 is stored on rack B-04 in the field station equipment shed.","search_document: The spare battery assigned to generator FS-18 is labeled BAT-22.","search_document: The field station inventory custodian for generator FS-18 is Imani Cole.","search_document: field station equipment inventory: the weather mast uses a separate calibration notebook.","search_document: field station equipment inventory: the satellite phone has an unrelated charging pouch.","search_document: field station equipment inventory: the sample freezer keeps a different temperature log.","search_document: field station equipment inventory: the trail camera kit is stored in an auxiliary cabinet.","search_document: field station equipment inventory: the first aid locker receives a monthly seal check.","search_document: field station equipment inventory: the water sampler has a separate replacement membrane.","search_document: field station equipment inventory: the solar controller displays an unrelated diagnostic code.","search_document: field station equipment inventory: the radio repeater uses another antenna bracket.","search_document: field station equipment inventory: the field kitchen counts a different fuel canister.","search_document: field station equipment inventory: the map case contains an unrelated survey grid.","search_document: field station equipment inventory: the microscope travels in a separate hard case.","search_document: field station equipment inventory: the snow sensor has an independent mounting note."],"truncate":false}